# Env files — none in use today, but ignored preemptively so one is never
# accidentally committed later. *.local above already catches .env.local
# and similar; this just adds the bare .env case. Deliberately not a
# broader .env.* pattern, which would also swallow a legitimate committed
# .env.example template.
.env

